.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|markdown/1.2
.# Only the code tags without attributes having a matching closing tag in the same paragraph are read as monospace:
.# the other code tags are read as HTML, as other tags. The tags overlapping a monospace content are not matched.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
